{"3968690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "除邪2(CHUXIE2)", "steam_appid": 3968690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the spiritual sequel to &quot;除邪(CHUXIE)&quot;. This time it will adopt a third-person perspective. You will play the role of an apprentice exorcist born into a Taoist family. Carrying a peach wood sword, you embark on a journey to slay demons and monsters, and go deep into the forest to search for clues of missing people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in a dense forest shrouded in perpetual fog, time and direction blur. Every twisted shadow harbors a hidden threat, and every unnatural sound pokes at your nerves. Relying on courage and wit, you must survive this cursed fog and uncover the horrifying truth behind the disappearances.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the dark forest or village, search for clues to missing persons, solve numerous puzzles, face fear, and use peach wood swords or firearms to fight against terrifying monsters</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Advanced movement system allows players to control their characters and engage in combat with a smooth experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A chilling horror experience, with spatial sound effects and realistic graphics that make you feel like you're right there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intense combat, players will face numerous terrifying, oppressive creatures, defeating them with a wooden sword and limited ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Monsters experience more realistic physical hit response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exploration and challenge, players must explore the map to find clues and ammunition to solve puzzles, while also finding ways to defeat powerful special enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Character costumes that can be collected and changed through the map.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the spiritual sequel to &quot;除邪(CHUXIE)&quot;. This time it will adopt a third-person perspective. You will play the role of an apprentice exorcist born into a Taoist family. Carrying a peach wood sword, you embark on a journey to slay demons and monsters, and go deep into the forest to search for clues of missing people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in a dense forest shrouded in perpetual fog, time and direction blur. Every twisted shadow harbors a hidden threat, and every unnatural sound pokes at your nerves. Relying on courage and wit, you must survive this cursed fog and uncover the horrifying truth behind the disappearances.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the dark forest or village, search for clues to missing persons, solve numerous puzzles, face fear, and use peach wood swords or firearms to fight against terrifying monsters</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Advanced movement system allows players to control their characters and engage in combat with a smooth experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A chilling horror experience, with spatial sound effects and realistic graphics that make you feel like you're right there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intense combat, players will face numerous terrifying, oppressive creatures, defeating them with a wooden sword and limited ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Monsters experience more realistic physical hit response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exploration and challenge, players must explore the map to find clues and ammunition to solve puzzles, while also finding ways to defeat powerful special enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Character costumes that can be collected and changed through the map.</p>", "short_description": "This time the player will play the role of a trainee exorcist,and her fi